    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Hand-Crafted Halloween World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Grumpy Jack</i> is brought to life in rich, detailed 2D animation, filled with strange creatures, forgotten corners, and unexpected charm. Every area feels unique, with something new to learn or stumble into around each bend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll meet quirky characters, unlock a wide range of skills, and piece together a story full of dry humor and odd surprises. Whether you're solving a puzzle, dodging a trap, or helping a skeleton with a strange request, there's always something weird and worth chasing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like classic top-down gameplay, oddball adventures, and a world that doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously, <i>Grumpy Jack</i> is ready to welcome you in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/f8b74b097e85f9e8ef187d2d046daa7f.avif?t=1747488945\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large, interconnected world with Metroidvania-style progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down action with challenging combat, fun puzzles, and platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn and master a wide variety of skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humorous story full of odd surprises and bizarre characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five difficulty modes, from relaxed to relentless</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D art and animation in a unique Halloween-inspired settin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/cea281d922deeb14dddc090d6ff9472b.avif?t=1747488945\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Hand-Crafted Halloween World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Grumpy Jack</i> is brought to life in rich, detailed 2D animation, filled with strange creatures, forgotten corners, and unexpected charm. Every area feels unique, with something new to learn or stumble into around each bend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll meet quirky characters, unlock a wide range of skills, and piece together a story full of dry humor and odd surprises. Whether you're solving a puzzle, dodging a trap, or helping a skeleton with a strange request, there's always something weird and worth chasing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like classic top-down gameplay, oddball adventures, and a world that doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously, <i>Grumpy Jack</i> is ready to welcome you in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/f8b74b097e85f9e8ef187d2d046daa7f.avif?t=1747488945\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large, interconnected world with Metroidvania-style progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down action with challenging combat, fun puzzles, and platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn and master a wide variety of skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humorous story full of odd surprises and bizarre characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five difficulty modes, from relaxed to relentless</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D art and animation in a unique Halloween-inspired settin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698230/extras/cea281d922deeb14dddc090d6ff9472b.avif?t=1747488945\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>",
